==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*The enemy base here is a [[Goal Plate Base (Enemy Base)|Goal Plate Base]].
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Knuckles (Enemy)|Knuckles]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Knuckles acts more as a support in this level, Angelic Slepnir is the main threat in this level. If you have [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], this stage becomes very easy. Be wary of the pushing power of the Gories, but proper meatshielding and backliners like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] should be enough to clear this stage.

